# Assess external input coherence and completeness

## Rule

Before formalizing external inputs into specifications, the process SHOULD assess coherence, consistency, and completeness, recording open questions and conflicts. A deliberate bypass MUST be acknowledged and MUST NOT be represented as a completed assessment.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
